# ── Serverless function budget ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Hobby plan deploys at most 12 Serverless Functions, and every file under
# api/ that is not in api/_lib/ counts as one. These two office-only endpoints
# take the count to 14, which fails the whole deployment with
# "No more than 12 Serverless Functions can be added to a Deployment".
#
# They are excluded rather than deleted because they cannot work in production
# yet either way: both read crm_price_map, the table created by
# api/_lib/migrations/003_crm_catalog.sql, which has not been applied. Drop these
# two lines together with running the migration and
# scripts/provision-crm-catalog.mjs — and free two slots first (retire
# api/internal/membership-recurring-test.js, or move the project to Pro).
#
# NOTE: api/_lib/payment-links.js is a library, not a route. It is NOT excluded —
# api/quote.js requires it, and libraries do not count against the budget.
api/payments/links.js
api/payments/manual.js
